  "id": "USN-8769-1",
  "summary": "phpseclib vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that phpseclib did not perform padding validation in\nconstant time when using AES in CBC mode. A remote attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to conduct a padding oracle timing attack and obtain\nsensitive information.",
